{"body": [{"y0": 67.2, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 405.5, "text": "frigid-. Ménsis anni brev- est Februarius. Padus est flümen"}, {"y0": 81.3, "x0": 150.6, "x1": 317.3, "text": "Italiae long- et lat-. Sol stélla clar- est."}, {"y0": 109.0, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 202.8, "text": "PENSVM B"}, {"y0": 123.0, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 405.3, "text": "Iànuàrius — primus est. December est ménsis — ac —. Tem-"}, {"y0": 136.0, "x0": 151.5, "x1": 405.3, "text": "pore antiquo September ménsis septimus —, nam — ménsis"}, {"y0": 149.9, "x0": 151.5, "x1": 403.8, "text": "primus erat Martius. Nunc September ménsis — est. Dies est"}, {"y0": 165.0, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 405.1, "text": "tempus à — ad —. Mane est — diei, vesper — diei est et"}, {"y0": 178.7, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 404.9, "text": "initum —. Diés in xil — dividitur. Nocte — et — lücent,"}, {"y0": 192.9, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 405.1, "text": "neque eae tam — sunt quam sol. Sol lünam — suà —. Ea"}, {"y0": 206.7, "x0": 150.8, "x1": 330.8, "text": "lünae pars quae sole nón illüstrátur — est."}, {"y0": 221.0, "x0": 159.8, "x1": 404.9, "text": "Vér et —, aestàs et — sunt quattuor — anni. — à ménse"}, {"y0": 234.8, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 405.1, "text": "Iünio —. Hieme nón solum —, sed etiam — dé nübibus"}, {"y0": 248.5, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 405.1, "text": "cadit: montés et campi nive —. Aqua nón tam — est quam"}, {"y0": 262.4, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 165.5, "text": "nix."}, {"y0": 290.3, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 202.8, "text": "PENSVM C"}, {"y0": 304.1, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 252.1, "text": "Quot sunt ménsés anni?"}, {"y0": 316.4, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 281.8, "text": "À quó Iànuàrius nómen habet?"}, {"y0": 331.8, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 289.5, "text": "Quam longus est mensis Aprilis?"}, {"y0": 343.9, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 298.4, "text": "À quó ménsis Iülius nómen habet?"}, {"y0": 359.6, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 324.8, "text": "Cür mensis decimus Octóber nóminàtur?"}, {"y0": 373.6, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 309.9, "text": "Cür lüna nón tam clàra est quam sol?"}, {"y0": 387.8, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 279.1, "text": "Qui diés anni brevissimus est?"}, {"y0": 401.5, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 280.4, "text": "Qui diés aequinoctia dicuntur?"}, {"y0": 415.2, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 306.3, "text": "Quod tempus anni calidissimum est?"}, {"y0": 429.2, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 278.4, "text": "Quandoó nix dé nübibus cadit?"}, {"y0": 443.3, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 218.3, "text": "Quid est imber?"}, {"y0": 455.9, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 282.7, "text": "À quo dié incipit annus novus?"}], "margin": [{"y0": 66.7, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 63.8, "text": "lüna"}, {"y0": 75.9, "x0": 48.7, "x1": 66.5, "text": "stella"}, {"y0": 84.7, "x0": 48.7, "x1": 59.7, "text": "lüx"}, {"y0": 93.7, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 69.4, "text": "forma"}, {"y0": 102.7, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 79.7, "text": "kalendae"}, {"y0": 112.1, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 63.3, "text": "idüs"}, {"y0": 122.0, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 69.4, "text": "nónae"}, {"y0": 130.4, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 97.1, "text": "aequinoctium"}, {"y0": 140.1, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 68.7, "text": "aestàás"}, {"y0": 148.8, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 69.6, "text": "hiems"}, {"y0": 158.3, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 59.7, "text": "vér"}, {"y0": 168.2, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 84.0, "text": "autumnus"}, {"y0": 175.8, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 69.4, "text": "imber"}, {"y0": 185.0, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 59.7, "text": "nix"}, {"y0": 194.1, "x0": 48.7, "x1": 66.2, "text": "lacus"}, {"y0": 203.1, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 71.8, "text": "glacies"}, {"y0": 212.3, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 64.4, "text": "urbs"}, {"y0": 222.4, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 85.3, "text": "posurémus"}, {"y0": 230.7, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 79.9, "text": "dimidius"}, {"y0": 241.8, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 73.2, "text": "aequus"}, {"y0": 248.9, "x0": 48.7, "x1": 69.4, "text": "clarus"}, {"y0": 258.8, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 65.8, "text": "totus"}, {"y0": 266.9, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 80.2, "text": "obscürus"}, {"y0": 276.2, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 75.5, "text": "exiguus"}, {"y0": 285.4, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 73.2, "text": "calidus"}, {"y0": 294.4, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 75.9, "text": "frigidus"}, {"y0": 303.6, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 95.7, "text": "indeclinàbilis"}